{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Mystery Hidden Object Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a hidden object game and a mystery game wrapped into one. First, you find hidden objects. These objects help you gather clues. Second, you use those clues to figure out who is the murderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, take up the mantel of Thelma Fantastic and see if you can become the world's greatest detective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is Thelma Fantastic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octogenarian, 12 grandkids, 2 husbands (both deceased), president of the local knitting club, and possibly the <strong>worlds greatest detective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/84942ace96b36233bc95c8c0fa6d07ca.avif?t=1773161468\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Missing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers you randomly generated scenes with hundreds of different objects to find throughout. You never know if you'll be looking for a basketball or a skull or a sort of dancing cactus thing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item in every scene has been hand drawn.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Solve the Mysteries?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding a bunch of objects you'll be given access to a set of clues. Take them to the big board with your suspects and see who fits the case. Once you're ready, make your accusation and see if you got it right.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/6c87b506acf9bc5eee7716d8d6084076.avif?t=1773161468\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dress Up Thelma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thelma has a range of items that make every run unique. Give her some night vision goggles to try the game in all green. Maybe you're tired of the rain effects? Equip an umbrella. <strong>Unlock and try all the combos!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hidden object levels and mysteries to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters to  learn about and suspect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of objects to find and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized levels.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Runs and Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping Cat.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Case Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/a5904fe1317baa9f7890ba0d523cf4d7d883b8ea.jpg"},{"name":"Two for the Show","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/416f7e35609092d7bd51104d3393cd7f8a34b9b5.jpg"},{"name":"Third Time's the Charm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/3d81ab288ff5a2e1ccffefb6498e612041ca4c46.jpg"},{"name":"Four One Out for Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/5d8c7749379060eb3fb15bc5b3e8d4ff965f216f.jpg"},{"name":"Five Star Sleuthin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/d908bebd357705fe42c4db0ecc067c2ddfee9f28.jpg"},{"name":"Six Feet Under","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/9ef89b271e90c59dc6c87dd47e4e15d6a4f51837.jpg"},{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827630/65b83d68ba5b2a7a25fd37a0093d3fba09161daa.jpg"},{"name":"A Perfect 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827